WEBVTT

00:08:59.855 --> 00:09:01.905
I'm not here to talk about my sex life.

00:09:01.929 --> 00:09:03.109
(Laughter)

00:09:03.133 --> 00:09:06.236
But let's just say it's fine.

00:09:06.260 --> 00:09:07.625
(Laughter)

00:09:08.622 --> 00:09:10.784
I'm fine, my body is fine.

00:09:10.808 --> 00:09:13.284
You actually wouldn’t be able
to tell the difference

00:09:13.308 --> 00:09:16.425
between me and another person
unless I told you;

00:09:16.449 --> 00:09:19.778
you wouldn't be able to tell
that I was intersex unless I told you.

00:09:20.223 --> 00:09:23.707
But again, because of the lack
of understanding about bodies,

00:09:23.731 --> 00:09:25.834
my doctor didn't understand
the difference.

00:09:26.723 --> 00:09:29.456
And for the most part,
my sex life is fine.

00:09:29.990 --> 00:09:31.799
The only issue that really comes up